  "identifier": "surveycore",
  "description": "Provides 'S7'-based infrastructure for survey analysis including design objects, metadata preservation, and variance estimation. Forms the foundation of the surveyverse ecosystem. Supports Taylor series, replicate weight, and two-phase designs with a 'tidyselect' interface for intuitive design specification. Automatic preservation of 'haven'-style variable and value labels throughout all operations.",
